om-brand-systems-on-freelance-budgets-using-ouch-illustrations" class="hover:underline text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight line-clamp-1">Delivering Custom Brand Systems on Freelance Budgets Using Ouch Illustrations</a><div class="text-sm text-muted line-clamp-1">Small business clients frequently present mood boards packed with massive tech company assets. Being an independent web designer means facing constant demands for that highly polished, unique aesthetic. Reality hits hard when you see their actual...</div></div></div><div class="flex flex-row justify-start gap-2 items-start"><span class="iconify i-lucide:circle-chevron-right size-4! min-w-4 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style=""></span><div><a href="/blog/mastering-video-titles-that-boost-ctr-without-clickbait" class="hover:underline text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight line-clamp-1">Mastering Video Titles That Boost CTR Without Clickbait</a><div class="text-sm text-muted line-clamp-1">A good video title is a determining factor when it comes to content being noticed or not. On websites such as YouTube, a title is usually the initial interaction between an author and a viewer. Exaggerated clickbait will get short-term clicks...</div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center gap-2"><a href="/pages/write-a-guest-post" data-slot="base" class="font-medium inline-flex items-center disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-75 aria-disabled:opacity-75 transition-colors rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs gap-1.5 ring ring-inset ring-accented text-default bg-elevated hover:bg-accented/75 active:bg-accented/75 disabled:bg-elevated aria-disabled:bg-elevated focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inverted"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><!--]--><!--[--> Write a Guest Post <!--]--><!--[--><!----><!--]--><!--]--></a><a href="/blog" data-slot="base" class="font-medium inline-flex items-center disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed